@startuml Benchmark_Sequence_Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20

actor User #lightgreen
participant "Orchestrator" as Orchestrator #lightyellow
participant "Benchmark\nRunner" as BenchmarkRunner #lightblue
participant "Main Node" as MainNode #lavender
participant "RabbitMQ" as RabbitMQ #wheat
participant "Worker" as Worker #lightcyan
participant "Analyzer" as Analyzer #pink

== 3. Analysis ==
BenchmarkRunner -->> Orchestrator: All experiments complete
Orchestrator -> Analyzer: **Analyze results**\n//poc_analyzer_main()//
activate Analyzer

Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Load all experiment dumps**
note right
  From: ./results/serialized/
  Load: experiment_*.pkl
end note

Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Compute statistics**
note right
  - Performance metrics
  - Convergence analysis
  - Comparison plots
end note

Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Generate visualizations**
note right
  Create plots:
  - Optimization progress
  - Configuration heatmaps
  - Performance comparison
end note

Analyzer -> Analyzer: **Create HTML report**
note right
  Template: report_template.html
  Output: benchmark_report.html
end note

Analyzer -> User: **Open HTML report**
note right
  Interactive report with:
  - Summary statistics
  - Plots and charts
  - Detailed results
end note
deactivate Analyzer
deactivate Orchestrator

User -> User: **Review results**

@enduml

